// EXCLUSIVE, NOT ADDITIVE. This SWAPS the table between active and deleted
// rather than adding deleted rows to the list, because there is no delegable
// way to show both: IsDeleted = <variable> folds into the server query, and
// IsDeleted = false || IsDeleted = true is an OR over a column that drops the
